    %% Employee flows
    Employee <-->|"Incident Submissions, Comments,<br/>Assigned Assets & Status Updates"| System

    %% Mailer flows
    System -->|"Overdue Ticket Warnings,<br/>Assignment & Reset Notifications"| External
